### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health


### Create Enquiry - Pricing
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "John Doe",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "I want to know the pricing details and cost of your plans"
}


### Create Enquiry - Booking
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Sarah Ahmed",
  "channel": "email",
  "message": "I would like to book an appointment and check available slots"
}


### Create Enquiry - Complaint
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "channel": "call",
  "message": "I have a serious complaint, the service is bad and I want a refund"
}


### Create Enquiry - After Hours
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Priya Singh",
  "channel": "whatsapp",
  "message": "Are you available after hours on the weekend or is the office closed"
}


### Create Enquiry - No SOP Match (triggers auto-escalation)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Alex Turner",
  "channel": "email",
  "message": "zxqwerty random gibberish message with no matching intent"
}


### Schedule Follow-up (replace 1 with a valid enquiry ID)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/1/followup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 30,
  "message_template": "Hi {name}, just following up on your enquiry. Please let us know if you need further assistance."
}


### Escalate Enquiry (replace 1 with a valid enquiry ID)
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/1/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer explicitly requested to speak with a human agent"
}


### Get Enquiry History (replace 1 with a valid enquiry ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/enquiry/1/history


### Edge Cases

### Follow-up on non-existent enquiry
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/9999/followup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delay_minutes": 15,
  "message_template": "Following up"
}


### Escalate non-existent enquiry
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry/9999/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Testing 404 handling"
}


### History of non-existent enquiry
GET http://localhost:8000/enquiry/9999/history


### Invalid payload - missing required field
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "John Doe"
}


### Invalid channel value
POST http://localhost:8000/enquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "John Doe",
  "channel": "telegram",
  "message": "This channel is not supported"
}